#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:1
msgid "Template API"
msgstr "API de plantillas"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:3
msgid "Template rendering helpers are available under `ptool.template` and `p.template`."
msgstr "Las utilidades de renderizado de plantillas están disponibles bajo `ptool.template` y `p.template`."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:5
msgid "ptool.template.render"
msgstr "ptool.template.render"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:7
msgid "`v0.1.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.1.0` - Introduced."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:9
msgid "`ptool.template.render(template, context)` renders a Jinja-style template string and returns the rendered result."
msgstr "`ptool.template.render(template, context)` renderiza una cadena de plantilla de estilo Jinja y devuelve el resultado renderizado."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:12
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:12"
msgid "`template` (string, required): The template source text."
msgstr "`template` (string, obligatorio): El texto fuente de la plantilla."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:13
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:13"
msgid "`context` (any serializable Lua value, required): The template context."
msgstr "`context` (cualquier valor Lua serializable, obligatorio): El contexto de la plantilla."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:14
msgid "Returns: The rendered string."
msgstr "Devuelve: La cadena renderizada."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:16
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:16"
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Ejemplo:"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:38
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:38"
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "Notas:"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:40
msgid "The context must be serializable to data values."
msgstr "El contexto debe poder serializarse como valores de datos."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:41
msgid "Lua values such as `function`, `thread`, and unsupported `userdata` are not accepted as template context values."
msgstr "Valores Lua como `function`, `thread` y `userdata` no admitidos no se aceptan como valores del contexto de la plantilla."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:43
msgid "Missing values use chainable undefined semantics. This means nested lookups such as `foo.bar.baz` can be passed to filters like `default(...)` without raising an error. When rendered directly without a fallback, undefined values become an empty string."
msgstr "Los valores ausentes usan semántica de undefined encadenable. Esto significa que búsquedas anidadas como `foo.bar.baz` pueden pasarse a filtros como `default(...)` sin producir error. Si se renderizan directamente sin un valor de reserva, los valores undefined se convierten en una cadena vacía."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:56
msgid "ptool.template.write"
msgstr "ptool.template.write"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:58
msgid "`v0.12.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.12.0` - Introducido."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:60
msgid "`ptool.template.write(path, template, context)` renders a Jinja-style template string and writes the rendered result directly to a file."
msgstr ""
"`ptool.template.write(path, template, context)` renderiza una cadena de "
"plantilla de estilo Jinja y escribe el resultado renderizado directamente en "
"un archivo."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:63
msgid "`path` (string, required): The destination file path."
msgstr "`path` (string, obligatorio): La ruta del archivo de destino."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:64
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:64"
msgid "`template` (string, required): The template source text."
msgstr "`template` (string, obligatorio): El texto fuente de la plantilla."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:65
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:65"
msgid "`context` (any serializable Lua value, required): The template context."
msgstr "`context` (cualquier valor Lua serializable, obligatorio): El contexto de la plantilla."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:66
msgid "Returns: Nothing."
msgstr "Devuelve: Nada."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/template.md:68
